            "ai_statement": "All of my projects are AI-driven, and today I almost always use Claude to write them. AI is used for writing code, reverse engineering compiled code, and the planning, designing, and the UI/UX of the project. I have programming skills, which does help steer Claude in the right direction. I strive to do basic testing of my applications to ensure that things work before making an initial release, and to fix bugs in the next release. I will not use AI to create imagery or videos, other than things like making simple logos or UI/UX designs. Full statement: https://github.com/quatric/quatric/blob/main/USAGE.md"
